# Local ephemeral artefacts (never intentional). The repo does NOT
# ship a lockfile: dependency resolution happens at install time
# from PyPI, against constraint ranges pinned in `pyproject.toml`.
# If a developer regenerates a lock locally for debugging, it stays
# out of the tree.
requirements*.lock.txt
